      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آطَامٌ مُؤَطَّمَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Lofty</i> [<i>fortresses,</i> &amp;c.]: (A, TA:)
[or it may signify <i>fortresses,</i> &amp;c., <i>disposed in
order,</i> or <i>grouped together;</i> for it is said to be] a
phrase like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْوَابٌ مُبَوَّبَةٌ</span>, (O, TA,) or like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْنَادٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَنَّدَةٌ</span>. (K.)

